                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This bill is a fantastic step in the right direction. We must not lose sight of the bigger picture. Millions of people will still struggle to pay for life-saving medication. We must allow Medicare to negotiate fair drug prices, and we must fight to pass #MedicareforAll.",
