                "text": "I\u2019m a two-time cancer survivor & dad of two kids with chronic illnesses. We got medical bills for tens of thousands of dollars & spent hours on the phone fighting insurance companies. So now I\u2019m championing #MedicareforAll and lower drug costs for all of our families.",
